  "Question": "Given \\(a\\parallel b\\) and \\(\\angle 1=110^\\circ\\), what is the measure of its same-side interior angle \\(\\angle 2\\), in degrees? (Lines \\(a\\) and \\(b\\) are cut by a third line; unit: degrees; enter only the numerical value.)",
