  "Correct Answer": "70",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "When two lines are parallel, same-side interior angles are supplementary, so \\(\\angle 2=180^\\circ-110^\\circ=70^\\circ\\).",
